<title>USA: U.S. corn gluten pellets steady; meal also flat.</title>
<headline>U.S. corn gluten pellets steady; meal also flat.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. corn gluten feed pellets were unchanged Wednesday in quiet trade, cash dealers said.</p>
<p>Pellet prices have fallen recently in response to a drop in the pace of exports to Europe, dealers said.</p>
